==History==
2016
*The Barbarians [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], decreased the Barbarians' hitpoints by 3%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Barbarians' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12). The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Barbarians' range to 0.7 tiles (from 1.2 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged.
2018
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians‘ attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds). It also increased the distance between the Barbarians upon deployment.
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], fixed an issue where the Barbarians' [[Star Points|Star Level]] used the sound effects of the [[Elite Barbarians]].
*On 4/3/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians' hitpoints by 13%. It also increased the Barbarians' count to 5 (from 4) and gave the Barbarians a new 0.15 second deploy stagger from each other.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Barbarians' card info screen.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the deploy stagger for each Barbarian to 0.1 seconds (from 0.15 seconds).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Barbarians‘ attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
*On 1/8/2022, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/8/2022)|August 2022 Update]], changed the Barbarians' card image and card render, by making them look pixilated.
*On 2/9/2022, a maintenance break, reverted the Barbarians' card image and card render to their state before 1/8/2022.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14), and added the Barbarians' Evolution. It also changed the Barbarians' card image and card render.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Barbarians' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed.

